{"schemaVersion":1,"id":228,"sections":[{"id":"358001-PROLOGUE","name":"第 1 战 · 战前","scripts":[20544],"start":0,"count":36},{"id":"358001-EPILOGUE","name":"第 1 战 · 战后","scripts":[20545],"start":36,"count":33}],"frames":[{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"358001-PROLOGUE:20544:1","scriptId":20544,"text":"由于一些新品种战车兽的出现，最近死水上上下下忙得不可开交。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"358001-PROLOGUE:20544:2","scriptId":20544,"text":"我们小队自然也不会例外，今天又接到了搜索机甲狼蛛的委托，已经是本周的第3次了。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"358001-PROLOGUE:20544:3","scriptId":20544,"text":"这种狼蛛的蛛丝可以制作防护性能极佳的战斗装备，于是被波西娅给盯上了。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"358001-PROLOGUE:20544:4","scriptId":20544,"text":"不过波西娅出手很大方，所以即便是有点危险的搜索工作我们也会照做就是了。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"358001-PROLOGUE:20544:5","scriptId":20544,"text":"“今天的委托是哪个战区的？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":4,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"358001-PROLOGUE:20544:6","scriptId":20544,"text":"","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":4,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":11,"speaker":"芮蓓","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"358001-PROLOGUE:20544:7","scriptId":20544,"text":"“那个……今天有点例外，需要你们去一趟乞力马扎罗山，波西娅博士在那里等你们。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":4,"right":11,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"358001-PROLOGUE:20544:8","scriptId":20544,"text":"“什么！？怎么那么突然？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":4,"right":11,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":11,"speaker":"芮蓓","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"358001-PROLOGUE:20544:9","scriptId":20544,"text":"“这个我无法回答您，我只是给波西娅博士传话的。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":4,"right":11,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":11,"speaker":"芮蓓","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"358001-PROLOGUE:20544:10","scriptId":20544,"text":"“专用运输机在C2停机坪，凭这张证明就可以登机。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":4,"right":11,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"358001-PROLOGUE:20544:11","scriptId":20544,"text":"芮蓓带着标准的营业式笑容递给我一张签有波西娅名字的凭证，凭证的反面粘着一份折叠式的地图。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":4,"right":11,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"358001-PROLOGUE:20544:12","scriptId":20544,"text":"由于是折叠着粘到凭证上的，所以只有撕开凭证才能看到地图的内容。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":4,"right":11,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":747,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"358001-PROLOGUE:20544:13","scriptId":20544,"text":"“恩？乞力马扎罗山在哪儿啊？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":4,"right":747,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"358001-PROLOGUE:20544:14","scriptId":20544,"text":"“赤道附近，过去要不少时间，好在波西娅给我们准备了专用运输机。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":4,"right":747,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"358001-PROLOGUE:20544:15","scriptId":20544,"text":"“都去准备一下吧，半小时后准备出发。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":4,"right":747,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"358001-PROLOGUE:20544:18","scriptId":20544,"text":"我们的运输机降落在了乞力马扎罗山脚下的一处平路上。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-05.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"358001-PROLOGUE:20544:19","scriptId":20544,"text":"由于山腰以上的山道都附有积雪不适合运输机降落，所以只能在一处山脚下降落。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-05.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"358001-PROLOGUE:20544:20","scriptId":20544,"text":"很巧的是在我们运输机的不远处，可以看到还有另一架运输机也停着，几个工作人员正在做着检修。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-05.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"358001-PROLOGUE:20544:21","scriptId":20544,"text":"“看来那架运输机是波西娅的，她应该也是从这里出发的。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-05.webp","left":4,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"358001-PROLOGUE:20544:22","scriptId":20544,"text":"我一边说着一边从怀里拿出带有地图的凭证，撕开凭证取下地图。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-05.webp","left":4,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"358001-PROLOGUE:20544:23","scriptId":20544,"text":"“这……汇合地点在山顶？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-05.webp","left":4,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":572,"speaker":"奈特莉","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"358001-PROLOGUE:20544:24","scriptId":20544,"text":"“啊？要登山？我看看”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-05.webp","left":4,"right":572,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"358001-PROLOGUE:20544:25","scriptId":20544,"text":"听到我诧异的语气，奈特莉凑过头来。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-05.webp","left":4,"right":572,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":572,"speaker":"奈特莉","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"358001-PROLOGUE:20544:26","scriptId":20544,"text":"“哇，还真是呢，长官要做好防寒措施啊～”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-05.webp","left":4,"right":572,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"358001-PROLOGUE:20544:27","scriptId":20544,"text":"“知道知道，我可是有准备过的，不过没想到那么快就要用上了。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-05.webp","left":4,"right":572,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":740,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"358001-PROLOGUE:20544:28","scriptId":20544,"text":"“长官怎么还带防寒设备的？多重啊。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-05.webp","left":4,"right":740,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"358001-PROLOGUE:20544:29","scriptId":20544,"text":"“我可不像你们可以自适应周围温度，真是让人羡慕。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-05.webp","left":4,"right":740,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":584,"speaker":"佩妮·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"358001-PROLOGUE:20544:30","scriptId":20544,"text":"“取而代之我们额外带了很多源奶，调节温度的消耗也很大，一般场合还是能省则省。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-05.webp","left":4,"right":584,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"358001-PROLOGUE:20544:32","scriptId":20544,"text":"一切准备就绪，我们踏上了前往山顶的旅途。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-05.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"358001-PROLOGUE:20544:33","scriptId":20544,"text":"然而还没走多远，就听到维卡的报告。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-05.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":596,"speaker":"维卡","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"358001-PROLOGUE:20544:34","scriptId":20544,"text":"“有一群……原核体正朝运输机的方向移动。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-05.webp","left":null,"right":596,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"358001-PROLOGUE:20544:35","scriptId":20544,"text":"“真是邪门，怎么还没走几步就开始有状况了。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-05.webp","left":4,"right":596,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":584,"speaker":"佩妮·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"358001-PROLOGUE:20544:36","scriptId":20544,"text":"“应该是幸运吧，正好我们还没离开多远，我和姐姐打先锋，想办法截住那些战车兽。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-05.webp","left":4,"right":584,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"358001-PROLOGUE:20544:37","scriptId":20544,"text":"“恩，那你们两个先去，把原核体的注意力从运输机那边引开。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-05.webp","left":4,"right":584,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":742,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"358001-PROLOGUE:20544:38","scriptId":20544,"text":"“了解～”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-05.webp","left":4,"right":742,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"358001-PROLOGUE:20544:39","scriptId":20544,"text":"（奇怪了，原核体为什么会出现在这种地方……？）","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-05.webp","left":4,"right":742,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"358001-EPILOGUE:20545:1","scriptId":20545,"text":"干掉了原核体后，我们继续前进。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-05.webp","left":4,"right":742,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"358001-EPILOGUE:20545:2","scriptId":20545,"text":"通往山顶的道路很长，不是一两天就能到的样子。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-05.webp","left":4,"right":742,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"358001-EPILOGUE:20545:3","scriptId":20545,"text":"想不通为什么波西娅要我们来这里。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-05.webp","left":4,"right":742,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"358001-EPILOGUE:20545:4","scriptId":20545,"text":"“波西娅这家伙自己都已经来了，为什么还要叫上我们？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-05.webp","left":4,"right":742,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"358001-EPILOGUE:20545:5","scriptId":20545,"text":"我说起话来略显吃力，身上沉甸甸的登山背包压得我有点喘不过气来。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-05.webp","left":4,"right":742,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":584,"speaker":"佩妮·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"358001-EPILOGUE:20545:6","scriptId":20545,"text":"“可能她遇到了什么问题？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-05.webp","left":4,"right":584,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":740,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"358001-EPILOGUE:20545:7","scriptId":20545,"text":"“或许是遇难了？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-05.webp","left":740,"right":584,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":572,"speaker":"奈特莉","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"358001-EPILOGUE:20545:8","scriptId":20545,"text":"“很难想象波西娅会遇难，怎么说她也是钢舞姬。如果是长官这样子的话，倒还真不好说～”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-05.webp","left":740,"right":572,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":596,"speaker":"维卡","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"358001-EPILOGUE:20545:9","scriptId":20545,"text":"“……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-05.webp","left":596,"right":572,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"358001-EPILOGUE:20545:11","scriptId":20545,"text":"沿着山道一路向前，没多久我们发现山道一侧的平坡上有一顶帐篷。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-05.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"358001-EPILOGUE:20545:12","scriptId":20545,"text":"“这年头还有人来登山？胆子有点大啊，不怕战车兽袭击吗？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-05.webp","left":4,"right":null,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"358001-EPILOGUE:20545:13","scriptId":20545,"text":"路过帐篷的时候，我就这么说了一句并没多想。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-05.webp","left":4,"right":null,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"358001-EPILOGUE:20545:14","scriptId":20545,"text":"结果从帐篷里伸出一只手把我连同行李一起拽进了帐篷。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-05.webp","left":4,"right":null,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":738,"speaker":"尤拉·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"358001-EPILOGUE:20545:15","scriptId":20545,"text":"“把刚才的话再说一遍听听？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-05.webp","left":4,"right":738,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"358001-EPILOGUE:20545:16","scriptId":20545,"text":"“诶？怎么是尤拉？我刚才指得是一般人啦……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-05.webp","left":4,"right":738,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"358001-EPILOGUE:20545:17","scriptId":20545,"text":"我环视了一下帐篷内的情况，发现波西娅和艾丽莎也都在帐篷内……","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-05.webp","left":4,"right":738,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":13,"speaker":"艾丽莎","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"358001-EPILOGUE:20545:18","scriptId":20545,"text":"“这次的帮手就是他们……？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-05.webp","left":4,"right":13,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"358001-EPILOGUE:20545:19","scriptId":20545,"text":"“波西娅和艾丽莎也在啊。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-05.webp","left":4,"right":13,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"358001-EPILOGUE:20545:20","scriptId":20545,"text":"这时候，小队里的其余三人也走进了帐篷。（维卡主动申请在帐篷外值岗。）","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-05.webp","left":4,"right":13,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":746,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"358001-EPILOGUE:20545:21","scriptId":20545,"text":"“诶？波西娅怎么在这里，不是说在山顶汇合吗？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-05.webp","left":4,"right":746,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":584,"speaker":"佩妮·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"358001-EPILOGUE:20545:22","scriptId":20545,"text":"“大概是出了什么问题吧？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-05.webp","left":584,"right":746,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":572,"speaker":"奈特莉","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"358001-EPILOGUE:20545:23","scriptId":20545,"text":"“没想到尤拉和艾丽莎都来了啊～难道真的是来体验登山的？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-05.webp","left":584,"right":572,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"358001-EPILOGUE:20545:24","scriptId":20545,"text":"佐伊她们进来之后你一句我一句吵吵嚷嚷的，帐篷一下子就显得有些狭小了。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-05.webp","left":584,"right":572,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"358001-EPILOGUE:20545:25","scriptId":20545,"text":"“本来确实是打算到山顶的观测小屋汇合的，不过现在没那个必要了。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-05.webp","left":608,"right":572,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"358001-EPILOGUE:20545:26","scriptId":20545,"text":"行军桌上铺展着一份地图，波西娅正在上面用圆规画着什么。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-05.webp","left":608,"right":572,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"358001-EPILOGUE:20545:27","scriptId":20545,"text":"待到她画完之后，波西娅把地图一收，走了过来。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-05.webp","left":608,"right":572,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"358001-EPILOGUE:20545:28","scriptId":20545,"text":"“从妮科尔的搜索情报来看，你们先去我画圈的这个地区寻找机甲狼蛛。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-05.webp","left":608,"right":572,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"358001-EPILOGUE:20545:29","scriptId":20545,"text":"（妮科尔……这个名字好像在哪儿听过？）","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-05.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"358001-EPILOGUE:20545:30","scriptId":20545,"text":"“了解了，我看看……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-05.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"358001-EPILOGUE:20545:31","scriptId":20545,"text":"毕竟波西娅是本次任务的总指挥，照着她的命令做就行了。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-05.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"358001-EPILOGUE:20545:32","scriptId":20545,"text":"“这个范围，大概要用一天的时间，没问题吧。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-05.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"358001-EPILOGUE:20545:33","scriptId":20545,"text":"“如果遇到机甲狼蛛，给我抓活的。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-05.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"358001-EPILOGUE:20545:34","scriptId":20545,"text":"“呃……尽量吧……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-05.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":1,"shake":false}],"summaries":[]}
